  "title": "Solvency II SCR Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate the indicative Solvency Capital Requirement (SCR) for a non-life insurer using the Solvency II Standard Formula (Delegated Regulation EU 2015/35). Covers non-life underwriting, market, and counterparty default risk modules with aggregation using prescribed correlation matrices. Excludes operational risk SCR, LACTP/LACDT, and life/health underwriting modules. Client-side. Zero PII.",
